          "content": "The descriptions are conceptual and pedagogical. No experiments requiring access to infectious material, clinical specimens, animals or specialized biosecurity facilities are needed or permitted by the lesson plan. Real research requires institution-specific ethical review, biosafety training and oversight. The synthetic case studies are not data collected from people, hospitals, laboratories or the environment. For work with real published material, cite the original source, verify context and licensing, and avoid reproducing identifiable records. Health, agricultural and public safety decisions should follow qualified professional guidance, not simplified student exercises.",
